{"version":1,"content":"<html><body><img alt=\"\" decoding=\"async\" loading=\"lazy\" src=\"https://pro-img-cdn.tvb.com/uploads/image/2026/11/2026Ud5E3lc14u1795707047.jpg?x-oss-process=image/resize,w_1200\"/><p>一艘貨船在西班牙伊維薩島附近海域翻船，造成1名船員死亡，6人受傷。</p><p></p><p>反轉的船漂浮在海上，當地媒體報道，涉事的貨船懸掛馬爾他旗，正駛往西班牙第二大城市巴塞羅那，載有約7,000噸柴油，現場海面發現少量燃油痕跡。</p><p></p><p><p><img alt=\"Picture_J.SPA.SHIP-2330.jpg\" decoding=\"async\" loading=\"lazy\" src=\"https://pro-img-cdn.tvb.com/uploads/image/2026/11/2026LiLmu30EB91795707166.jpg?x-oss-process=image/resize,w_1200\"/></p></p><p></p><p>該貨船周四凌晨在伊維薩島以北30海里翻船，船上共有17人，一名土耳其籍船員送院後不治，其餘傷者亦已送到附近醫院救治。</p><p></p><p>當局指海上救援部門，已調派處置污染物洩漏的船，前往事發海域，並派遣飛機在上空巡查，評估燃油泄漏情況。</p></body></html>","scraped_at":"2026-11-26T16:44:22.423877+00:00","quality":{"score":1,"chars":214,"images":2,"source":"TVB 新聞","fallback":"none","origin":"article-html","completeness":"extracted"},"published_at":"2026-11-26T15:20:00+00:00","fetched_at":"2026-11-27T16:37:35.294379+00:00","content_updated_at":"2026-11-26T16:37:36.472936+00:00","content_hash":"3e81b133d6a8a39d6ba38d6b36346c48f5a5cefab26ba8ad228a23b18ad37dbb","evidence_status":"full","scrape_error":null,"content_retention":{"scraped_at":"2026-11-26T16:44:22.423877+00:00","latest_fallback":"rss-budget","latest_error":null},"content_capture":null}